OL,3,GNEWSAArson suspect bailed after
OL,4,Aderelict care home fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old arrested following a
OL,7,Ffire at a derelict care home has been
OL,8,Freleased on police bail.
OL,10,FThe fire on London Road, Liss, broke
OL,11,Fout at about 23:15 BST on Tuesday
OL,12,Fnight.  Around 60 firefighters were
OL,13,Fsent to the scene with crews working
OL,14,Fthrough the night to put the fire out.
OL,16,FAll three floors as well as the roof of
OL,17,Fthe building were engulfed in the blaze
OL,18,Fwith parts of the building collapsing
OL,19,Fleaving a charred shell.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
