OL,3,GNEWSAArson suspect bailed after
OL,4,Aderelict care home fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire and Isle of Wight police said
OL,7,Fthe man from Portsmouth, arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of arson, had been released
OL,9,Fon bail until 11 November.
